    {
      "page_idx": 9,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.235,
            0.067,
            0.762,
            0.139
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "The Debugging Problem"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.201,
            0.439,
            0.259
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "• What if there is a bug?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.274,
            0.463,
            0.326
          ],
          "content": "§ Graphic does not display"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.337,
            0.469,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": "§ Input does not work right"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.405,
            0.411,
            0.461
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "• Have to find the bug"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.476,
            0.442,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": "§ Isolate bad line of code"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.541,
            0.427,
            0.591
          ],
          "content": "§ Requires visualization"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.603,
            0.405,
            0.656
          ],
          "content": "§ Typically use print()"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.039,
            0.671,
            0.464,
            0.727
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "• But this will print a lot!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.743,
            0.455,
            0.794
          ],
          "content": "§ Overwhelmed by output"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.807,
            0.419,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": "§ Hard to find anything"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.526,
            0.283,
            0.982,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_9_image_11.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 10,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.067,
            0.801,
            0.138
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Managing Your Diagnostics"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.203,
            0.878,
            0.266
          ],
          "content": "• The print() approach has two main problems"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.285,
            0.72,
            0.341
          ],
          "content": "§ Prints all the time, even if no problem"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.36,
            0.784,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": "§ Lots of prints means it scrolls by very fast"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.44,
            0.892,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": "• To control the first problem, **toggle the print**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.521,
            0.682,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": "§ Create **special input** for debugging"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.595,
            0.727,
            0.65
          ],
          "content": "§ Use that input to turn on/off as needed"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.674,
            0.742,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": "• To control the second, **print to a file**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.757,
            0.476,
            0.808
          ],
          "content": "§ A file can be searched"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.831,
            0.688,
            0.887
          ],
          "content": "§ A file can be compared against runs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 11,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.065,
            0.891,
            0.139
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Logger: A Class to Support Logging"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.199,
            0.23,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": "import debug"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.269,
            0.338,
            0.325
          ],
          "content": "tool = debug.Logger()"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.337,
            0.323,
            0.392
          ],
          "content": "tool.setFile('log.txt')"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.385,
            0.254,
            0.574,
            0.354
          ],
          "content": "Can be None for screen only"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.037,
            0.465,
            0.487,
            0.521
          ],
          "content": "tool.log('This is always printed')"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.037,
            0.533,
            0.478,
            0.591
          ],
          "content": "tool.debug('This is not printed')"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.542,
            0.563,
            0.733,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": "Only prints if verbose is True"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.037,
            0.661,
            0.344,
            0.715
          ],
          "content": "tool.setVerbose(True)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.037,
            0.73,
            0.445,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": "tool.log('This is still printed')"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.8,
            0.556,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "tool.debug('This is printed this time')"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.725,
            0.783,
            0.909,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": "See firelog.py"
        }
      ]
    }
